AccessToken / RefreshToken flow:
- Register / Login
- Gets: accessToken (15min) + refreshToken (7 days)
- Every request --> Send accessToken in Authorization header
- After 15min --> accessToken expires
- Next request --> 401 error
- Frontend intercepts 401 error --> Sends refreshToken to /api/auth/refresh
- Server validates refreshToken --> Rotates it:
 - Old refreshToken revoked in DB
 - New refreshToken created in DB
 - New accessToken created
 - New refreshToken and new accessToken sent back

- Frontend receives: New accessToken + new refreshToken
- Frontend retries original request with new accessToken
- Back to normal --> Repeat cycle every 15min
- After refreshToken expires --> Rejected --> Force logout --> Must login again

